# Build context for Dockerfile.sim-adapter (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in place of the root .dockerignore). Everything is excluded, then only what the
# adapter imports is let back in, so the context is kilobytes rather than the tree.
*
!adapters/__init__.py
!adapters/simulation/
!adapters/scenarios/
!proto/fleet_adapter/v1/fleet_adapter_pb2.py
!proto/fleet_adapter/v1/fleet_adapter_pb2_grpc.py
!sdk/python/src/swarmada_sdk/
**/__pycache__
**/*.md
